# SOQL Queries

## Query 1: WHERE Clause Query

```sql
SELECT Id, Name, Service_Type__c, Estimated_Cost__c
FROM Appointment__c
WHERE Service_Type__c = 'Oil Change'


##Query 2: ORDER BY + LIMIT

SELECT Id, Name, Estimated_Cost__c
FROM Appointment__c
ORDER BY Estimated_Cost__c DESC
LIMIT 5


##Query 3: Relationship query (child-to-parent)

SELECT Name, Vehicle__r.Name, Vehicle__r.Customer_Name__c 
FROM Appointment__c


##Query 4: Aggregate query with COUNT() / GROUP BY

SELECT Service_Type__c, COUNT(Id) 
FROM Appointment__c 
GROUP BY Service_Type__c


##Query 5: Comparison operator (>=) on a date or number field

SELECT Name, Date__c, Estimated_Cost__c 
FROM Appointment__c 
WHERE Estimated_Cost__c >= 1000
